Comment: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.46,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why not?
Comment: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.38,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,You can sit in the back.
Comment: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:31.01,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,And while we're at it, would you please move my things from my Fiat into your car?
Comment: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:32.43,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,All right.
Comment: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:33.52,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the bother.
Comment: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:47.34,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,Young lady, I don't mean to intrude.
Comment: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:50.72,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,But the headmaster of my primary school always used to say
Comment: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:55.73,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,that success comes to those who seize the day,
Comment: 0,0:04:56.48,0:05:04.23,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,while those who let a golden opportunity pass by will never get a second chance.
Comment: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:22.81,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,A man kind enough to give a strange old lady a lift
Comment: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:26.19,DCAN-Main,,0,0,0,,would never throw his cigarettes out of the window of his car in front of his daughter.
